    "detailed_description": "Explore the world and delve dungeons, fight foes and bosses, steal spells, farm, fish, mine ores, open locks, take quests from the many factions and interesting characters, experience optional non-standard game overs, change form, turn back time, and more in this Adult Open World Immersive Sim RPG by CulixCupric.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContains content for adult audiences only. (Turned on in options, or at the start of the game. Pick what you like, block what you don't.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay as Mara Alvah, last princess of Ubscura, having escaped to the present from the past during a siege on her home, and decide where to go from there. (The prologue is short, and skippable.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n8 major dungeons, and multiple side dungeons.<br />\r\nIncrease Life, Magic, and Stamina at standing stones with experience gained from power crystals.<br />\r\nNPCs with randomized and adapting quests, as well as services such as healing and crafting.<br />\r\nMultiple conflicting factions. Join them, or use their conflicts to your advantage, attack them to ruin your reputation with them, or sneak by them as they fight.<br />\r\nFarming, fishing, mining, and cooking.<br />\r\nTime reversal: Go back in time with your character progress and inventory to undo all quest progress and reset faction reputations.<br />\r\nNon-standard defeat/game over scenes and transformations.<br />\r\nPlay beyond game overs, switch factions, become a monster.<br />\r\nUncover the lore of a post-industrial fantasy apocalypse.",
